WEBVTT

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.930
A little higher.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.450
Higa-san, you're a good cook.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:24.250
I used to help around my family's 
guesthouse back in Okinawa.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.420
Really?

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.920
Tomo-chan, we're finished over here.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.590
Oh, wow.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.340
You two worked really hard, too.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.800
Anyone could manage this.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.650
Are we ready now?

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:39.560
I think so.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.530
Okay, let's do it!

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.020
Yeah!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.940
<b>#4  I Won't Let You Take Natsumi-chan!</b>

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.950
Welcome, Shiki-sensei!

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.490
<b>Welcome Shiki-sensei</b>

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.490
Wh-What is this for?

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:28.290
This way.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.750
What's going on?

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.670
Have a seat.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.140
Have some tea.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.380
Take your time.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.590
What on earth is this?

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:43.600
Here's your food.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.430
It's red rice and quiche, rape blossoms 
with dressing, and potato salad.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.560
Bon appétit.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.230
Bon appétit!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.400
Uh, okay. Thanks for the food.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.130
It's good. It's too good.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.450
There's plenty more if you want some.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.410
Have as much as you'd like.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.880
Thank you.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:14.120
So, what's all this for?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.840
<b>New Club Application</b>

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.830
A bicycle club?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.490
Yeah, we're thinking of forming one.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:25.130
But we need a faculty 
adviser to start a club.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.510
We want you to do it.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.560
I see.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:33.440
I did tell you to find clubs, but I 
wasn't expecting you to form a new one.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.660
You already know a lot about bicycles.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.190
Please, Sensei.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.400
Please.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.380
I'll do it.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:46.090
I'll be the bicycle club's adviser.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.070
All right!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.450
It worked!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.700
Are you sure?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:59.840
I'm actually required to be 
an adviser for a club, too.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:04.600
I'm not very good at teaching, right?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.670
But I can probably teach 
you girls about bicycles.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:08.940
I'm sure it won't be a problem.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.230
<i>I feel like she just casually 
said something insane.</i>

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.580
Now we can form our club.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.120
Yeah, the bicycle club is good to go.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.240
Now that I'm feeling relieved, I'm hungry.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.320
Oh, Hiromi.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.450
I'll make some plates for 
the rest of you, too.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.410
It's so good.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.040
Yeah, it really is.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:33.540
I designate Natsumi the bicycle club's cook.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.270
What else can you cook?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:39.930
Well, I can make most Okinawan dishes.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:42.040
Okinawan food, huh?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.010
Come to think of it, I don't 
think I've ever had any.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.050
I'll make some tebichi next time.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.150
Tebichi?

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.120
It's stewed pig's feet.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.400
Really?

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.050
Yeah, make that.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:56.350
So, what is the bicycle club going to do?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:05:00.130
Cycling? Pottering is fun, too.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:03.800
Or you could practice hard 
and participate in races.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.360
Well, I just want to ride bikes.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:08.700
Me, too.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:13.120
I'd like to go places I haven't 
been without too much work.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.670
I'd like to travel to someplace far away.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.870
Like Hokkaido.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:18.710
Great idea.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.130
We should dream big.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.600
I agree.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.380
I see. I get it.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.170
For now, you just want to ride bicycles.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.790
That's good enough to start.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.080
Yes! Nice time.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.850
Way to go, Hiroko.

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:46.590
Hiroko's doing well this year, and we have 
that promising first-year joining, too.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.630
Our team will get even stronger.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:52.870
It's an emergency!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:06:01.190
The only bikes your bicycle club 
has are Maiharu-san's mommy bike

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.980
and Higa-san's road bike, huh?

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:06.090
Those are two very different bicycles.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.380
I'm planning to buy one.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.590
Me, too.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.100
There's a bike shop next 
to Nagisa-san's bakery.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.900
Maiharu-san, what are you going to do?

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:21.780
I was thinking about riding 
this one for a while longer.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:22.400
Really?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.470
Isn't the saddle a bit low?

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.490
It started creeping down as I was riding it.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.740
We should adjust it.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.490
Hey, Higa-san?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.160
Azuma-senpai...

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.410
I thought you were joining our team.

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:39.480
What?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.580
Who is she?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.880
Azuma Hiroko-senpai, a second-year
 on the swim team.

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.900
Isn't Azuma Hiroko...

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.200
You know her?

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.520
Hold on.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.600
I'm replaying my mental video right now.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:58.080
<b>Promising Newbie Azuma Hiroko</b>

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:59.720
That's right. She placed second at 
the national swim meet last year.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.550
She was in the volleyball club before,

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:04.570
but she switched to swimming 
after injuring her knee.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.100
And placed second at a national swim meet?

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.900
That's amazing.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.400
What's she doing here?

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.460
I heard you joined another club.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:15.910
What club did you join?

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.210
The bicycle club.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.410
The bicycle club?

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.430
Does that exist?

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.370
We're forming it ourselves!

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:28.570
That principal must've approved 
a new club on a whim again.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.760
It won't last.

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.520
What are you going to do about the swim team?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.560
I never said I'd join.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:41.670
But you have to join.
We need promising new members.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:47.570
We can't let you off that easily.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.890
Let's settle this with a bicycle race.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.370
Wait...

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.870
Why me?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:05.190
You'd have an advantage if Higa-san 
rode her fast-looking bike.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.880
In order to make things fair,

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:12.960
the negative of your ability is balanced 
out by the positive of that bike.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:17.510
And I'm balanced out by your bike.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:20.420
That calculation doesn't make any sense.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.890
How do you know Hiromi's ability is negative?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.900
Y-Yeah! I could be super fast.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.990
I saw you riding your bike on the 
day of the entrance ceremony.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.500
It's okay.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.660
I don't need you to hold the bike anymore.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.400
See?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.750
Wait, Hiromi. Where are you going?

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.210
Of course.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.910
But why a bike race?

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:54.260
Because I'd win if it were a swim race.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.840
The rules are simple.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:02.700
Whoever bikes to the top 
of this hill first wins.

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.730
I'll even give you a handicap.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.850
I'll start one minute after you.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:12.690
You can even have someone push 
you for the first 15 meters.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.360
But I'd still have an advantage...

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.830
Is there anything else I can give you?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:22.130
How about if your body always 
has to be touching your bike?

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.750
Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.330
Yeah.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:28.300
This should be an easy win.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:32.520
She must be fast.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.130
Sensei...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.200
Give it a shot, Maiharu-san.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.470
It may be your first time riding 
a road bike, but you'll have fun.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.550
I'm not sure it's that easy.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:44.280
These handlebars look scary.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.670
Hiromi-san, I'll show you how to ride it.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.940
Higa-san...

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.900
This shifts the gear up.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:54.090
Press this with the brake lever,
and you'll shift down.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.190
And this is the brake.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:01.270
The levers are shaped differently, 
but it works just like a cross bike.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:05.550
You were able to ride the cross bike, 
so you should be fine on a road bike.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.250
Easier said than done.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.910
It's okay.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:11.590
I learned to ride Natsumi's 
bike in no time at all.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.170
What? Really?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:18.440
If you ask me, it's easier to ride 
a bike than work a remote control.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.190
Hiromi, don't worry.

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.650
It didn't take you long to learn 
how to ride your mommy bike, either.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.460
I'm sure you'll be fine on the road bike.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.730
It's easier than you think.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.360
Maybe, but...

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:31.980
What?

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.590
What's wrong with these pedals?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:34.650
Aren't they kind of small?

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:37.800
Oh, right. They're clipless pedals.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.280
Here. You should be fine, since I 
switched them out for platform pedals.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.040
I lowered the saddle a little, too.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.990
My butt hurts.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.960
Are you ready?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.270
Yeah, we're good to go.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.550
We'll be waiting at the finish line.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.840
You can do it, Hiroko.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.720
I'm really going to race.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:09.140
Hiromi-san, I'll push you.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.390
Higa-san...

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.220
I'm sorry.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:14.730
It's my fault this is happening.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.950
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:21.700
<i>If I lose, Higa-san will join the swim team.</i>

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:26.230
I don't want that.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:32.020
Higa-san's going to ride bikes with us.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:35.840
Higa-san, I'll do my best.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.500
Yeah, thanks.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.470
You can do it.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.610
It's not scary, it's not scary.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.930
Let's both give it everything we've got.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.270
Yeah.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:58.230
On your marks! Ready...

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.740
Go!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.910
On your marks! Ready...

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.100
Go!

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:25.390
I'm so unsteady! It's scary!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.450
Hiromi-san, you have to pedal!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.620
If you don't pedal, you'll fall down!

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.580
S-Sorry!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.700
Keep pedaling!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.610
O-Okay!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.330
I'm letting go!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.570
What? Already?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.820
You can do it!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.280
Okay, then.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.500
Time for me to get going.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.590
Wh-What?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:07.050
Did you forget that your body always 
has to be touching your bike?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.530
What? You mean I can't stand and pedal?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.490
That's not a problem.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:16.480
Here I go!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.270
Huh?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.330
Oh, no! I'm not getting any power.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.700
Why? I can't turn the pedals at all.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.950
Azuma-senpai seems to be having 
trouble climbing the hill.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.560
She's slower than I expected.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:36.670
Maybe she's not good on land,
since she's a swimmer.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.040
No, she's just not able to 
use most of her muscles.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:40.630
What?

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:45.180
You can feel your muscles exerting 
the most force just before

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:48.220
they're fully extended, right?

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:54.590
If your saddle is set to the right height, 
you can fully utilize your leg muscles.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.110
But if it's too low,
you can't stretch your legs,

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.690
and you're limited in the way 
you can use your muscles.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.940
In other words, she's not 
getting the most out of them.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:07.310
On flats, you can manage regardless 
of the saddle's height.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:11.440
But when you're climbing hills,
you need to make full use of your muscles,

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.620
so your saddle's height becomes important.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.960
That saddle was too low for Maiharu-san, 
so it must be even worse for Azuma-san.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:25.490
Azuma-san can only partially use her muscles,
 while Maiharu-san can fully use hers.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.630
That's what you call fair.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.640
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:44.070
This is starting to get hard.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.650
I think I'm about halfway up.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.400
Where's Azuma-senpai?

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.820
She looks really mad.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:54.280
But I'm pretty far ahead.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.410
Hiromi-san, shift down!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.470
What? Shift down?

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.850
Um, is this it?

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:07.920
Oh, wow.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.480
Now it's easier than before.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.640
I might actually be able to win.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.940
Damn it.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.930
I won't let it end like this.

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:24.310
Even if I'm not allowed to stand,
I can still use my legs if I do this.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.360
Not bad.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.340
I caught up.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:34.990
Target locked.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.740
Hiromi, you can do it!

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.190
Hiroko!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.470
You're almost there!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.670
<i>I'm almost there.</i>

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.380
<i>I can do it.</i>

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.040
<i>If I lose, they'll take Higa-san!</i>

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.880
<i>I can't let that happen!</i>

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.300
<i>Almost there.</i>

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.220
<i>I'm almost there!</i>

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.310
Goal!

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.950
Hiromi-san...

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.160
I won.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.130
I lost.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.150
Nice job, Hiroko.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.450
We knew you would win.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.880
Of course.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.040
Sorry, Higa-san.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.970
It's my fault you have to join the swim team.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.310
Who said anything about that?

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:45.520
What? But isn't that what we were racing for?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.940
No. We can't help that 
she joined another club.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:54.200
We just couldn't let you take our 
potential club member that easily.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.200
And I feel better about letting 
you have her after winning, too.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:02.040
Are you saying Higa-san 
can join the bicycle club?

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.470
She's free to do what she wants.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.520
We did it, Higa-san.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:11.450
Yeah, but I wasn't going to 
quit whether you won or lost.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.340
Really?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.260
Thanks for trying so hard.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:16.380
Sure.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.510
Hiroko, you're so mean.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.810
You like competition too much.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.080
What's wrong with that?

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:26.390
It's fun to try something besides
swim races once in a while.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:27.400
That was fun.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:28.680
Sure.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.290
Look behind you.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:34.990
What?

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:39.810
Wow, I can see all the way to the ocean.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.560
Wow.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:45.960
I didn't realize I could see this view 
while I was at the bottom of the hill.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.940
Just by climbing up a little hill like this,
 you can see a totally different view.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:57.630
There are things you'll never know 
or see if you don't go there.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.580
There are things I've learned 
since I started swimming.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.630
Now that you've formed a club,

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.730
you should experience things you 
never would've known otherwise.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.890
Yeah.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:11.560
Oh, but if your club disbands, 
we're taking Higa-san.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:12.320
What?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.660
Y-You can't have her!

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.150
Hiromi!

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:18.570
Did you lose?

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:21.030
Yeah, but it's okay.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.030
You did fine riding the road bike.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.420
But my butt really hurts...

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.940
It must've split in two.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:30.900
Oh, no...

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:31.880
You can do it.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.900
There she is.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:45.060
Sorry. Thanks for waiting.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:50.210
Nice to meet you, everyone. 
I'm Akizuki Yuika.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.270
Huh? You're that girl from the other day.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.150
Oh, it's you!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.930
What? You know each other?

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.230
Yeah, I ran into her when 
I got lost the other day.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:00.660
Thanks for your help.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.370
No problem.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.180
Yuika, what did you want to show us?

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:10.230
Oh, right. You formed a 
bicycle club together, right?

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.130
So I thought you might need...

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.510
Ta-dah! A bicycle club uniform.

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:16.590
Uniforms?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.590
I designed one for you to wear.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:22.590
Clubs always wear matching uniforms, right?

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.580
It's pink! Pink!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.280
It's so flashy and cute.

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:29.290
Hearts with angels wings, huh? That's cute.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.900
What a fantastic design.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.610
Uniforms, huh?

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.780
You're right. We should have them.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:42.030
Yeah! Since everyone likes it,
let's go with this design.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.560
Yeah.

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.200
Thanks, Yuika-chan.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:47.800
I'm glad you like it.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:53.580
All right. The Minami Kamakura 
Girls' Bicycle Club is a go!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.210
Cheers!

